 artyr: St. Sebastian was an officer in the Roman army, esteemed even by th
 e heathen as a good soldier, and honored by the Church ever since as a cha
 mpion of Jesus Christ. Born at ISTarbonne, Sebastian came to Eome about th
 e year 284, and entered the lists against the powers of evil.
