 hop, Martyr: St. Timothy was a convert of St. Paul. He was born at \mJ Lys
 tra in Asia Minor. His mother was a Jewess, but his father was a pagan; an
 d though Timothy had read the Scriptures from his childhood, he had not be
 en circumcised as a Jew.
