SUMMARY:Sexagesima Sunday (sd)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Violet\n\nSt. John of Matha\, C\n\nLives of the
  Saints — ST. JOHN OF MATHA: St. John of Matha was one long course of V-
 / self-sacrifice for the glory of God and the good of his neighbor. As a c
 hild, his chief delight was serving the poor; and he often told, them he h
 ad come into the world for no other end but to wash their feet.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
