DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260224
SUMMARY:St. Peter Damian\, BpCD (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nVigil of St. Matthias\nFast\n\nLives o
 f the Saints — ST. PETER DAMIAN: St. Peter Damian was born in 988, and l
 ost both parents at an early age. His eldest brother, in whose hands he wa
 s left, treated him so cruelly that a 3unger brother, a priest, moved by h
 is piteous state, sent him to the University of Parma, where he acquired g
 reat distinction.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
