SUMMARY:St. Casimir\, C (sd)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Lucius I\, PM\nFast\n\nLives of th
 e Saints — ST. CASIMIR, King: St. Casimir was born a. d. 1458. From the 
 custody of a most virtuous mother, Elizabeth of Austria, he passed to the 
 guardianship of a devoted master, the learned and pious John Dugloss. Thus
  animated from his earliest years by precept and example, his innocence an
 d piety soon ripened into the practice of heroic virtue.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
