DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSs. Soter & Caius\, PpMm\n\nLives of t
 he Saints — ST. SOTER, Pope, Martyr: St. Soter was raised to the papacy 
 upon the death of St. Anicetus, in 173. By the sweetness of his discourses
  he comforted all persons with the tenderness of a father, and assisted th
 e indigent with liberal alms, especially those who suffered for the faith.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
