DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Peter of Verona\, M\n\nLives of th
 e Saints — ST. PETER, Martyr: St. Peter was born at Verona of heretical 
 parents. He went to a Catholic school, and his Manichean uncle asked what 
 he learnt. " The Creed," answered Peter; "I believe in God, Creator of hea
 ven and earth." No persuasion could shake his faith, and at fifteen he rec
 eived the habit from St.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
