DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. CATHERINE 
 OF SIENA: St. Catherine of Siena was raised up to be the guide and guardia
 n of the Church in one of the darkest periods of its history, the fourteen
 th century. As a child, prayer was her delight. She would say the Hail Mar
 y" on each step as she mounted the stairs, and was granted in reward a vis
 ion of Christ in glory.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
