DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Red\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. JOHN BEFORE 
 THE LATIN GATE: St. John Before the Latin Gate was the only surviving *-* 
 apostle, and governed all the churches of Asia, was apprehended at Ephesus
 , and sent prisoner to Rome. The Emperor Domitian did not relent at the si
 ght of the venerable old man, but condemned him to be cast into a caldron 
