 \nLives of the Saints — ST. MARGARET OF SCOTLAND: St. Margaret of Scotla
 nd was like a precious pearl. A life spent amidst the luxury of a royal co
 urt never dimmed i-ts lustre, or stole it away from Him who had bought it 
