DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Green\n\nSt. Aloysius Gonzaga\, C\n\nLives of t
 he Saints — ST. ALOYSIUS GONZAGA: St. Aloysius Gonzaga was born on the 9
 th of March, 1568. The first words he pronounced were the holy names of Je
 sus and Mary. When he was nine years of age he macle a vow of perpetual vi
 rginity, and by a special grace was ever exempted from temptations against
  purity.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
