DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Red\n\nHistorical note — Father Lasance Missa
 l: Pius IX established this feast in thanksgiving for the restoration of t
 he Papal See\; the Precious Blood is honored as the price of redemption.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
