DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Red\n\nSs. Rufina & Secunda\, VvMm (sd)\nComple
 te Abstinence\n\nLives of the Saints — THE SEVEN BROTHERS, Martyrs, and:
  The. FELICITAS, their Mother. THE illustrious martyrdom of these Saints h
 appened at Eome, under the Emperor Antoninus. The seven brothers were the 
 sons of St. Felicitas, a noble, pious. Christian widow in Rome, who, after
  the death of her husband, served God in a state of continency and employe
 d herself wholly in prayer, fasting, and works of charity.
