 as born at Florence, a. D999. S Following the profession of arms at that t
 roubled period, he became involved in a blood-feud with a near relative. O
 ne Good Friday, as he was riding into Florence accompanied by armed men, h
 e encountered his enemy in a place where neither could avoid the other.
