DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nComplete Abstinence\n\nLives of the Sa
 ints — ST. ALEXIUS: St. Alexius was the only son of parents pre-eminent 
 among the Roman nobles for virtue, birth, and wealth. On his wedding-night
 , by God's special inspiration, he secretly quitted Eome, and journeying t
 o Edessa, in the far East, gave away all that he had brought with him, con
 tent thenceforth to live on alms at the gate of Our Lady's church in that 
 city.
