DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. MARY MAGDA
 LEN: St. Mary Magdalen was "a woman who was a sinner." From the depth of h
 er degradation she raised her eyes to Jesus with sorrow, hope, and love. A
 ll covered with shame, she came in where Jesus was at meat, and knelt behi
 nd him.
