SUMMARY:St. Martha\, V (sd)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Felix II & Comp.\, Mm\n\nLives of 
 the Saints — ST. MARTHA, Virgin: T. John" tells us that " Jesus loved Ma
 rtha and Mary and Lazarus,' and yet but few glimpses are vouchsafed us of 
 them. First, the sisters are set before us with a word. Martha received Je
 sus into her house, and was busy in outward, loving, lavish service, while
  Mary sat in silence at the feet she had bathed with her tears.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
