SUMMARY:St. Ignatius of Loyola\, C (dm)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nComplete Abstinence\n\nHistorical note
  — Father Lasance Missal: St. Ignatius founded the Society of Jesus afte
 r his conversion from military life\; his body is venerated in Rome.\n\nLi
 ves of the Saints — ST. IGNATIUS OF LOYOLA: St. Ignatius of Loyola was b
 orn at Lojola in Spain, in the year 1491. He served his king as a courtier
  and a soldier till his thirtieth year. At that age, being laid low by a w
 ound, he received the call of divine grace to leave the world.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
