DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Violet\n\nSt. Eusebius\, C\nComplete Abstinence
 \n\nLives of the Saints — ST. EUSEBIUS, Priest: St. Eusebius was impriso
 ned in his room by order of the Emperor Constantius, and sanctified his ca
 ptivity by constant prayer. Another Saint of the same name, a priest and m
 artyr, is commemorated on this day.
