SUMMARY:ASSUMPTION OF THE BVM (d1cl)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — THE ASSUMPTION
  OF THE: The VIRGIN MARY. OTS this festival the Church commemorates the ha
 ppy departure from life of the Blessed Virgin Mary, and her translation in
 to the kingdom of her Son, in which she received from Him a crown of immor
 tal glory, and a throne above all the other Saints and heavenly spirits.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
