SUMMARY:St. Bernard\, AbD (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nWithin the Octave\n\nLives of the Sain
 ts — ST. BERNARD: St. Bernard was bom at the castle of Fontaines, in Bur
 gundy. The grace of his person and the vigor of his intellect filled his p
 arents with the highest hopes, and the world lay bright and smiling before
  him when he renounced it forever and joined the monks at Citeaux.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
