DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260822
SUMMARY:St. Jane Frances de Chantal\, W (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nWithin the Octave\nComplete Abstinence
 \n\nLives of the Saints — ST. JANE FRANCES DE CHANTAL: St. Jane Frances 
 De Chantal was placed under the care of a worldly-minded governess. In thi
 s crisis she offered herself to the Mother of God, and secured Mary's prot
 ection for life. When a Protestant sought her hand, she steadily refused t
 o marry " an enemy of God and His Church," and shortly afterwards, as the 
 loving and beloved wife of the Baron de Chantal, made her house the patter
 n of a Christian home.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
