DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. LOUIS, Kin
 g: =\HB mother of Louis told him she would rather see him W/ die than comm
 it a mortal sin, and he never forgot her words. King of France at the age 
 of twelve, he made the defence of God's honor the aim of his life. Before 
 two years, he had crushed the Albigensian heretics, and forced them by str
 ingent penalties to respect the Catholic faith.
