DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. EDWARD THE
  CONFESSOR: St. Edward the Confessor was unexpectedly raised to the throne
  of EngVJl land at the age of forty years, twenty-seven of which he had pa
 ssed in exile. On the throne, the virtues of his earlier vears, simplicity
 , gentleness, lowliness, but above all his angelic purity, shone with new 
 brightness.
