DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
SUMMARY:St. John Cantius\, C (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. JOHN CANTI
 US: St. John Cantius was born at Kenty in Poland in 1403, and studied at C
 racow with great ability, industry, and success, while his modesty and vir
 tue drew all hearts to him. He was for a short time in charge of a parish;
  but he shrank from the burden of responsibility, and returned to his life
  of professor at Cracow.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
