DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Ursula & Comp.\, VvMm\n\nLives of 
 the Saints — ST. URSULA, Virgin and Martyr: H NUMBER of Christian famili
 es had intrusted the education of their children to the care of the pious 
 Ursula, and some persons of the world had in like manner placed themselves
  under her direction. England being then harassed by the Saxons, Ursula de
 emed that she ought, after the example of many of her compatriots, to seek
  an asylum in Gaul.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
