SUMMARY:STS. SIMON & JUDE\, App (d2cl)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Red\n\nHistorical note — Father Lasance Missa
 l: St. Simon was called the Zealot\; St. Jude\, also called Thaddeus\, is 
 traditionally invoked in difficult cases.\n\nLives of the Saints — STS. 
 SIMON and JUDE: [iMOX was a simple Galilean, called by Our Lord to be one 
 of the pillars of His Church. Zelotes, "the zealot," was the surname which
  he bore among the disciples. Armed with this zeal he went forth to the co
 mbat against unbelief and sin, and made conquest of many souls for His div
 ine Lord.
