SUMMARY:25th Sunday after Pentecost (sd)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Green\n\nSt. Cecilia\, VM\n\nLives of the Saint
 s — ST. CECILIA, Virgin, Martyr: XN the evening of her wedding-day, with
  the music of the marriage-hymn ringing in her ears, Cecilia, a rich, beau
 tiful, and noble Roman maiden, renewed the vow by which she had consecrate
 d her virginity to God. "Pure
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
