SUMMARY:St. Sylvester\, Ab (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Peter of Alexandria\, BpM\n\nLives
  of the Saints — ST. PETER OF ALEXANDRIA,: St. Peter of Alexandria was t
 he first to pronounce against the schismatics, Melitius and Arius, and whi
 ch, despite the united efforts of powerful partisans, he strenuously uphel
 d, proves that he possessed as much sagacity as zeal and firmness.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
