SUMMARY:1st Sunday of Advent (sd)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: Violet\n\nSt. Saturninus\, M\n\nLives of the Sa
 ints — ST. SATURNINUS, Martyr: .TUENiNUS went from Eome, by direction of
  Pope Fabian, about the year 245, to preach the faith in Gaul. He fixed hi
 s episcopal see at Toulouse, and thus became the first Christian bishop of
  that city. There were but few Christians in the place.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-30-c99c9eb5-9ea5-5ef6-824f-7366cef96825@traditional-calendar-20
