SUMMARY:St. Francis Xavier\, C (dm)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. FRANCIS XA
 VIER: St. Francis Xavier was making a name for himself as a Professor of P
 hilosophy in the University of Paris, and had seemingly no higher aim, whe
 n St. Ignatius of Loyola won him to heavenly thoughts. After a brief apost
 olate amongst his countrymen in Pome he was sent by St.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-12-04-9e22d650-bb7f-57cd-bbc3-e325a112a85f@traditional-calendar-20
