DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261205
SUMMARY:St. Peter Chrysologus\, BpCD (d)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nSt. Barbara\, VM\nComplete Abstinence\
 n\nFirst Friday of the Month\n\nLives of the Saints — ST. BARBARA, Virgi
 n, Martyr: St. Barbara was brought -up a heathen. A tyrannical father, Dio
 scorus, had kept her jealously secluded in a lonely tower which he had bui
 lt for the purpose. Here in her forced solitude, she gave herself to praye
 r and study, and contrived to receive instruction and Baptism by stealth f
 rom a Christian priest.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
