DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nWithin the Octave\n\nLives of the Sain
 ts — ST. SYLVESTER, Pope: St. Sylvester was bom in Rome toward the close
  of the third century. He was a young priest when the persecution of the C
 hristians broke out under the tyrant Diocletian. Idols were erected at the
  corners of the streets, in the market-places, and over the public fountai
 ns, so that it was scarcely possible for a Christian to go abroad without 
 being put to the test of offering sacrifice, with the alternative of apost
 asy or death.
